	(footprint "cec-Connector_Screw:XFCN_T34069_Daughterboard_BoltPad_M3_PROVISIONAL"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "d36e3829-edc3-4284-822c-a27c569b666c")
		(at 23.5 18.2)
		(descr "PROVISIONAL two-sided exposed-copper M3 bolt land for a vertical daughterboard fastened to the threaded side face of XFCN T34069. Primary current/heat interface is direct flat terminal-face to exposed F.Cu land; the B.Cu washer distributes preload and is not credited as a parallel conductor or thermal path. Do not insert grease, elastomer, thermal pad, or unspecified conforming material. The four terminal legs solder only to the horizontal main PCB. The 3.4 mm plated normal-clearance hole, face flatness/finish, washer envelope, screw-axis height, and board-edge datum require incoming-part measurement and coupon qualification before release. Add symmetric via stitching immediately outside the measured contact area.")
		(tags "XFCN T34069 daughterboard bolt pad M3 clearance provisional sample verify")
